asih\u201d, mereka menjawab, \u201cSiapakah yang Maha Pengasih itu? Apakah kami harus sujud kepada Allah yang engkau (Muhammad) perintahkan kepada kami (bersujud kepada-Nya)?\u201d Dan mereka makin jauh lari (dari kebenaran).","enText":"And when it is said to them, \"Prostrate to the Most Merciful,\" they say, \"And what is the Most Merciful? Should we prostrate to that which you order us?\" And it increases them in aversion.","readText":"wa i\u017c\u0101 q\u012bla lahumusjud\u1ee5 lir-ra\u1e25m\u0101ni q\u0101l\u1ee5 wa mar-ra\u1e25m\u0101nu a nasjudu lim\u0101 ta`murun\u0101 wa z\u0101dahum nuf\u1ee5r\u0101","audio":"https:\/\/everyayah.com\/data\/Alafasy_64kbps\/025060.mp3","juz":19,"manzil":4,"page":365,"ruku":314,"hizbQuarter":146,"sajda":true},{"verseId":61,"ayahText":"\u062a\u064e\u0628\u0670\u0631\u064e\u0643\u064e \u0627\u0644\u0651\u064e\u0630\u0650\u064a\u0652 \u062c\u064e\u0639\u064e\u0644\u064e \u0641\u0650\u0649 \u0627\u0644\u0633\u0651\u064e\u0645\u064e\u0627\u06e4\u0621\u0650 \u0628\u064f\u0631\u064f\u0648\u0652\u062c\u064b\u0627 \u0648\u0651\u064e\u062c\u064e\u0639\u064e\u0644\u064e \u0641\u0650\u064a\u0652\u0647\u064e\u0627 \u0633\u0650\u0631\u064e\u0627\u062c\u064b\u0627 \u0648\u0651\u064e\u0642\u064e\u0645\u064e\u0631\u064b\u0627 \u0645\u0651\u064f\u0646\u0650\u064a\u0652\u0631\u064b\u0627","indoText":"Mahasuci Allah yang menjadikan di langit gugusan bintang-bintang dan Dia juga menjadikan padanya matahari dan bulan yang bersinar.","enText":"Blessed is He who has placed in the sky great stars and placed therein a [burning] lamp and luminous moon.","readText":"tab\u0101rakalla\u017c\u012b ja'ala fis-sam\u0101`i bur\u1ee5jaw wa ja'ala f\u012bh\u0101 sir\u0101jaw wa qamaram mun\u012br\u0101","audio":"https:\/\/everyayah.com\/data\/Alafasy_64kbps\/025061.mp3","juz":19,"manzil":4,"page":365,"ruku":315,"hizbQuarter":146,"sajda":false},{"verseId":62,"ayahText":"\u0648\u064e\u0647\u064f\u0648\u064e \u0627\u0644\u0651\u064e\u0630\u0650\u064a\u0652 \u062c\